&#x1F496;CELEBRATE THE YEAR OF SNAKE WITH SUNRISE EVENTS VIETNAM&#x1F496;

&#x2728;As we celebrate the Lunar New Year of the Snake, everyone at Sunrise Events Vietnam wants to send a huge thank you to all the athletes, partners, and sponsors. Your support has been key to our success in 2024, and we truly appreciate every moment we&#x2019;ve shared &#x2013; from facing challenges to making great memories together.

Looking ahead to 2025, we wish you all a year filled with prosperity, good health, and happiness. Let&#x2019;s keep working together to create even more value for Vietnam&#x2019;s sports community. We can&#x2019;t wait to see you at our events this year!
-----
SEV is the organizer of endurance sports events in Vietnam: VinFast IRONMAN 70.3 Viet Nam, BIM Group IRONMAN 70.3 Phu Quoc, BIM Group 5150 Phu Quoc, SUNRISE SPRINT Viet Nam, IRONKIDS Viet Nam, IRONKIDS Phu Quoc, Techcombank Hanoi International Marathon, Techcombank Ho Chi Minh City International Marathon and KIDS RUN Presented by ILA.

