unformatted_about:
              Established in 1995, Gamuda Land is the property arm of Gamuda Berhad, the leading engineering, construction, and infrastructure group in Malaysia and one of Asia’s premier companies. 

Gamuda Land marked its presence in the Vietnamese market with its first international project in 2007. Over the years, Gamuda Land Vietnam has made a strong impact with outstanding developments in major urban areas such as Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City, along with promising projects in rapidly growing regions like Thu Duc, Binh Chanh, Binh Duong, Dong Nai, and Hai Phong.

Our Vision: "Advancing regionally in shaping communities where people aspire to live and thrive for generations."

Our Brand Values: When we get the place right, the town works
We are guided by our values, seen throughout every community, offering sustainability, smart initiatives, master planning & innovation.

Our Brand Promises:
- Being Responsible Town-maker;
- Caring for people and communities;
- Respect nature and its environment;
- Driving innovation to create value;

At Gamuda, we aim to be the environmental, social and governance (ESG) leader in the engineering and infrastructure sector. Our people are the driving force behind our successes and milestones. Hence, we emphasize equal opportunity and are committed to attracting, developing and retaining a diverse and inclusive workforce through various upskilling and reskilling opportunities.

Our values define who we are, and we believe in creating a high-performance work culture that’s fair and welcoming for all.

