Location: Kosmos, Tay Ho, Hanoi

Entering the comfortable lobby area with full storage space and soft cushioned shoe seats, and the art painting becomes the main focal point, bringing an artistic touch as soon as you enter the apartment.
Stepping inside is the dining area designed with a youthful and individual shape with an impressive jet-black wooden dining table. Composed of curves and round blocks, the dining table set create a dynamic, friendly and safe feeling for families with young children.
